                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "174bcf64-ac42-35a0-a53c-56042b53cb1d",
                        "entry_id": "10543acd-b20f-30f1-be95-c1c4329ae3ce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sock with a separated big toe and a fastener at the ankle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "701f8b1a-e076-4cc8-96cd-69d756126a74",
                                "sense_id": "174bcf64-ac42-35a0-a53c-56042b53cb1d",
                                "text": "They hand their sandals to the attendant and wear a peculiar footglove made of silk."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40e0542c-17e1-42d7-a5a2-377a7fff72a6",
                                "sense_id": "174bcf64-ac42-35a0-a53c-56042b53cb1d",
                                "text": "On this sad occasion the speck of mud on her footglove was brought to her attention at a party by the glance of a male guest."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf44ce06-4a75-47cf-924d-35f1bd783c3c",
                                "sense_id": "174bcf64-ac42-35a0-a53c-56042b53cb1d",
                                "text": "I sit on a stool and bend over and slip a sock on my left foot; but I catch a toe-nail as I start to pull on the right footglove."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "425dcbdb-51bb-4bc9-970a-da98615f5522",
                                "sense_id": "174bcf64-ac42-35a0-a53c-56042b53cb1d",
                                "text": "The zô-ri is occasionally worn in the house over bare feet, but most general for indoor use is the tabi, a padded white cotton sock or footglove with thick sole and a separate stall for the large toe."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e539bd37-f044-3341-9631-713030a7d3b8",
                        "entry_id": "10543acd-b20f-30f1-be95-c1c4329ae3ce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A leather slipper designed for comfort and suppleness."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "306a2d06-cf6b-4bbd-b8e8-4087d2f22f44",
                                "sense_id": "e539bd37-f044-3341-9631-713030a7d3b8",
                                "text": "I never did nor ever shall employ your bootmaker, though I think I recollect trying once to get a pair of footgloves ( why not as well footgloves as handshoes, as the Germans say ) made by him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dfc59d1-6831-4e26-ab26-34bbc046053c",
                                "sense_id": "e539bd37-f044-3341-9631-713030a7d3b8",
                                "text": "Have you ever heard of footgloves? They are just a pair of soft-soled leather slippers which fold up and fit into a leather case designed to travel in a man's coat pocket or a woman's satchel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9538402c-b259-4229-b410-fcd2c4201550",
                                "sense_id": "e539bd37-f044-3341-9631-713030a7d3b8",
                                "text": "[…] described as having the quality of a \"footglove\"."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
